WEBVTT

00:09.944 --> 00:11.944
mkvdrama.me

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.184 --> 01:42.968
=Episode 24=
(Into the Future's Future Together)

01:47.352 --> 01:50.488
(Four Years Later)
(Zhi's Wish List)

01:51.224 --> 01:54.020
(Go to Luoyang to see the grottoes.)

01:56.856 --> 01:58.845
(Road trip to the Northwest.)

02:34.040 --> 02:35.040
Zhi.

02:36.839 --> 02:38.040
You talked in your sleep.

02:38.279 --> 02:39.480
What did I say?

02:41.679 --> 02:43.320
You said a man's name.

02:47.799 --> 02:48.959
Impossible.

02:50.279 --> 02:51.279
Really.

02:52.160 --> 02:53.360
It was you, right?

02:55.519 --> 02:56.519
No.

02:56.839 --> 02:57.880
Still angry.

02:59.640 --> 03:00.640
I recorded it.

03:01.399 --> 03:02.399
Listen to it.

03:02.999 --> 03:05.119
Let's see if our relationship is over.

03:06.480 --> 03:07.760
(I.M. Pei)

03:08.160 --> 03:10.519
(Designer of the Suzhou Museum.)

03:11.920 --> 03:13.279
Scared me to death.

03:13.399 --> 03:14.480
I.M. Pei.

03:14.880 --> 03:15.959
I was wondering who it was.

03:17.200 --> 03:18.200
What do you mean?

03:18.399 --> 03:19.080
Who?

03:19.320 --> 03:20.320
Who else could it be?

03:20.880 --> 03:21.641
No one.

03:21.641 --> 03:22.999
I only love you.

03:26.320 --> 03:26.800
Stop it.

03:26.800 --> 03:27.959
I need to draw now.

03:29.160 --> 03:30.640
Get up and draw.

03:31.559 --> 03:32.000
Do you know

03:32.000 --> 03:33.600
it's really tiring sleeping next to you.

03:34.160 --> 03:35.320
You talk in your sleep,

03:35.519 --> 03:36.400
and grind your teeth.

03:36.400 --> 03:38.160
Who still does that in their twenties?

03:38.360 --> 03:39.920
Who grinds their teeth?

03:40.480 --> 03:41.559
You.

03:41.559 --> 03:43.239
If you don't love me,
then don't force it.

03:44.760 --> 03:46.040
Try to love you one more time.

03:47.119 --> 03:47.920
I'm getting up.

03:48.119 --> 03:49.320
Wash up and then go out.

03:49.320 --> 03:50.399
Where are you going?

03:50.399 --> 03:51.399
To the bookstore.

03:51.640 --> 03:52.640
Do you want me with you?

03:53.080 --> 03:53.679
No need.

03:53.880 --> 03:54.880
I can go by myself.

03:55.559 --> 03:56.679
Really?

04:04.344 --> 04:06.840
(Top ten places for wedding photography)

04:48.888 --> 04:55.672
(How to build a castle of love?)

05:05.499 --> 05:08.248
(He's going to propose to me, right?)

05:38.839 --> 05:39.880
Following me?

05:39.880 --> 05:41.560
Is this bookstore yours?

05:42.959 --> 05:44.640
Why suddenly start reading Mr. Bai?

05:44.640 --> 05:46.680
Because your book is unfinished?

05:50.680 --> 05:53.120
Your future father-in-law called me.

05:53.479 --> 05:55.279
He said he wants to take you to dinner.

05:55.479 --> 05:56.479
Tonight?

05:58.880 --> 05:59.880
Buy it.

06:02.640 --> 06:03.640
So sudden.

06:18.000 --> 06:18.519
You two.

06:18.519 --> 06:19.519
Dad.

06:20.680 --> 06:21.680
What a coincidence.

06:21.760 --> 06:23.359
You seem to be in good health lately.

06:23.680 --> 06:24.640
Look at these two.

06:24.640 --> 06:25.440
How well they match.

06:25.560 --> 06:26.560
Mr. Xu.

06:28.640 --> 06:29.440
Ms. Wei.

06:29.440 --> 06:30.240
Grocery shopping?

06:30.359 --> 06:31.440
Come, give it to me.

06:32.080 --> 06:32.519
Alright.

06:32.519 --> 06:33.360
Ms. Wei.

06:33.360 --> 06:34.599
Wei Lin isn't on holiday yet?

06:34.599 --> 06:36.159
It's later at Qingyi University.

06:36.159 --> 06:37.359
It'll take two more days.

06:38.359 --> 06:39.359
Look.

06:40.080 --> 06:41.839
Doesn't it seem like I've gained a son?

06:41.839 --> 06:43.200
Not at all like

06:43.440 --> 06:44.800
losing a daughter.

06:46.359 --> 06:47.760
You two need to stop.

06:49.080 --> 06:50.120
How are you talking to me?

06:50.120 --> 06:50.680
Seriously.

06:51.120 --> 06:52.399
How are you talking to your Dad?

06:55.599 --> 06:56.680
Seems

06:56.880 --> 06:57.959
my new son

06:57.959 --> 06:59.800
loves me more than my old daughter does.

07:01.200 --> 07:02.599
Look at how pleased you are.

07:02.599 --> 07:03.599
Hurry home to cook.

07:03.599 --> 07:03.881
Yes.

07:03.881 --> 07:05.080
Otherwise, it'll be too late.

07:05.200 --> 07:06.200
Let's go.

07:09.640 --> 07:10.640
What?

07:11.479 --> 07:12.080
Nothing.

07:12.240 --> 07:14.000
Suddenly feel I love you more.

07:15.864 --> 07:17.496
Remember freshman year's winter break?

07:19.080 --> 07:19.800
"Shy Boy Chen."

07:20.000 --> 07:22.039
"I missed you a lot
when I was in Beijing."

07:22.039 --> 07:24.080
"But once I returned to Qingyi,
I don't miss you."

07:24.080 --> 07:24.959
"Focus on yourself."

07:24.959 --> 07:25.519
"Go for it."

07:25.519 --> 07:26.279
Haha.

07:26.279 --> 07:26.880
Who is it?

07:27.159 --> 07:27.959
So heartless.

07:27.959 --> 07:28.760
You're laughing?

07:28.760 --> 07:29.681
You're so annoying.

07:29.681 --> 07:31.359
Weren't you saying that at the time?

07:31.359 --> 07:31.880
You.

07:32.159 --> 07:33.359
Don't push your luck.

07:33.880 --> 07:34.880
Mr. Xu.

07:35.080 --> 07:36.080
She kicked me.

07:37.640 --> 07:39.519
I think she might
have violent tendencies.

07:39.519 --> 07:40.240
Do something.

07:40.479 --> 07:41.479
You still call me Mr. Xu.

07:41.919 --> 07:43.039
I can't handle this.

07:43.039 --> 07:44.039
Really?

07:44.440 --> 07:45.440
Dad, do something.

07:46.320 --> 07:47.599
Even less I can do.

07:47.919 --> 07:48.919
- What?
- Shameless.

07:49.640 --> 07:50.279
Do something.

07:50.279 --> 07:50.959
Xu Zhi.

07:51.279 --> 07:53.240
What do you plan to do in the future?

07:53.440 --> 07:54.081
Well...

07:54.081 --> 07:55.200
It depends on him.

07:56.240 --> 07:56.760
Right.

07:57.039 --> 07:58.680
For girls, in matters like this,

07:59.080 --> 08:01.000
it's better to let the boy
take the initiative.

08:19.519 --> 08:20.560
Are you still watching?

08:23.599 --> 08:24.480
Mr. Xu said

08:24.480 --> 08:26.279
he and Ms. Wei will return
after their walk.

08:26.399 --> 08:28.240
They saw a newly opened fruit shop.

08:28.240 --> 08:29.279
They asked what I want.

08:29.440 --> 08:30.839
Why didn't he ask me?

08:32.440 --> 08:33.479
Didn't Mr. Xu say that I

08:34.160 --> 08:35.320
love him more than you do.

08:37.839 --> 08:38.839
So soon?

08:39.719 --> 08:40.719
Mr. Xu.

08:42.599 --> 08:43.599
You...

08:44.759 --> 08:45.920
Isn't Yingying with you?

08:46.440 --> 08:47.239
Why are you here?

08:47.239 --> 08:47.879
She's not here.

08:48.080 --> 08:49.080
Looking for Yingying.

08:50.800 --> 08:52.119
You two quarreled again?

08:52.119 --> 08:53.440
What was it about this time?

08:54.359 --> 08:55.639
I'm really having a hard time.

08:55.639 --> 08:56.639
You know?

08:57.280 --> 08:58.239
In the second year,

08:58.239 --> 08:59.239
she was too much.

08:59.359 --> 09:00.839
No matter what I say or do,

09:00.920 --> 09:01.920
she thinks it's wrong.

09:02.320 --> 09:03.879
But I'm doing it for her own good.

09:04.040 --> 09:04.879
She doesn't get it.

09:04.879 --> 09:05.560
She blocked me.

09:05.560 --> 09:06.560
And she blames me.

09:07.800 --> 09:09.080
I can't keep living like this.

09:09.839 --> 09:11.280
Although I really want to help,

09:11.599 --> 09:12.600
in this regard,

09:12.600 --> 09:13.800
we really have no experience.

09:14.680 --> 09:15.839
We argue too little.

09:17.920 --> 09:18.759
Okay.

09:18.759 --> 09:19.759
Yes.

09:20.200 --> 09:22.520
Thinking back to when Mr. Zhi
was tormenting you

09:22.800 --> 09:23.480
I still thought

09:23.480 --> 09:24.800
my brother was really miserable.

09:25.160 --> 09:27.560
I didn't expect that I'm much more
miserable than you now.

09:28.639 --> 09:29.800
When was I ever miserable?

09:30.520 --> 09:31.639
Zhi treats me well.

09:32.999 --> 09:34.400
Has anyone raced a car for you?

09:34.879 --> 09:36.440
Has anyone ever built a house for you?

09:37.879 --> 09:39.959
Zhi celebrates my birthday
twice a year for me.

09:40.800 --> 09:41.200
Right.

09:41.639 --> 09:42.936
You celebrate every four years.

09:45.479 --> 09:46.120
Chen Luzhou,

09:46.120 --> 09:47.520
you heartless man.

09:47.520 --> 09:48.999
You put love before me?

09:50.080 --> 09:51.080
Say that again.

09:51.440 --> 09:52.440
What did you just say?

09:53.400 --> 09:53.840
You...

09:53.840 --> 09:54.999
Dandan Fried Buns.

09:54.999 --> 09:55.999
Are you coming?

09:59.160 --> 10:00.160
Are we going?

10:00.440 --> 10:01.440
Yes.

10:01.639 --> 10:02.639
Then...

10:03.520 --> 10:04.759
This, three skewers.

10:05.479 --> 10:06.479
This, three skewers.

10:08.599 --> 10:09.119
Dan.

10:09.119 --> 10:10.080
There you are.

10:10.080 --> 10:10.520
Delicious?

10:10.520 --> 10:11.520
Dandan.

10:11.719 --> 10:12.240
This time,

10:12.240 --> 10:13.440
which girl are you letting

10:13.440 --> 10:14.680
wait in my shop again?

10:14.680 --> 10:16.239
Why do you enjoy this?

10:16.440 --> 10:17.599
You have to ask him.

10:18.200 --> 10:18.920
You...

10:19.119 --> 10:19.639
Hurry in.

10:19.999 --> 10:20.999
Three servings of this.

10:21.440 --> 10:22.440
Three servings.

10:22.560 --> 10:22.999
Too much.

10:22.999 --> 10:23.999
Yingying.

10:24.599 --> 10:25.599
Zhi.

10:31.160 --> 10:31.719
Why?

10:31.959 --> 10:32.959
Go sit over there.

10:35.239 --> 10:36.680
No one asked you to come.

10:37.040 --> 10:38.119
Why join in the fun?

10:38.639 --> 10:39.759
I haven't said anything yet.

10:39.759 --> 10:40.759
Look, she's like that.

10:42.080 --> 10:43.080
I called him to come.

10:43.239 --> 10:45.080
Aren't we all quite busy with work?

10:45.200 --> 10:46.440
It's been a while.

10:52.400 --> 10:53.879
I've nearly finished ordering dishes.

10:53.959 --> 10:55.520
Zhi, see what you want to eat.

10:56.920 --> 10:58.080
No need to order more dishes.

10:58.080 --> 10:59.080
Let's buy some drinks.

11:00.759 --> 11:01.080
Alright.

11:01.080 --> 11:02.080
Let's go buy them.

11:02.239 --> 11:03.239
Let's go.

11:03.560 --> 11:03.879
I...

11:03.879 --> 11:04.879
Buy drinks.

11:11.879 --> 11:13.440
We'll just have these dishes.

11:13.440 --> 11:13.879
Thanks.

11:13.879 --> 11:14.360
Alright.

11:14.360 --> 11:15.400
Then wait a moment.

11:16.639 --> 11:18.040
What's going on?

11:18.440 --> 11:19.599
Don't want to be together?

11:19.599 --> 11:20.639
Always blocking him.

11:20.879 --> 11:21.800
Why bring him up?

11:21.800 --> 11:22.800
Buzzkill.

11:24.119 --> 11:25.719
You're about to graduate
your fifth year.

11:25.719 --> 11:26.719
Do you have any plans?

11:27.359 --> 11:28.359
No plans.

11:28.639 --> 11:29.719
I don't care.

11:29.999 --> 11:30.999
At most, break up.

11:31.999 --> 11:32.840
Alright.

11:32.840 --> 11:34.479
Don't put on airs anymore.

11:35.160 --> 11:35.801
You go back

11:35.801 --> 11:37.119
and Yingying ignores you.

11:37.320 --> 11:39.160
Don't you still
have to go back groveling?

11:44.040 --> 11:45.440
Quite experienced.

11:45.800 --> 11:47.599
Who just said they never argue?

11:48.400 --> 11:49.400
We really don't argue.

11:49.800 --> 11:51.280
Mainly, in the end,

11:51.280 --> 11:52.400
we guys all have to give in.

11:53.160 --> 11:54.160
Right?

11:55.560 --> 11:57.200
Why do you have to act up yourself,

11:57.200 --> 11:58.520
and slap yourself in the face?

11:58.920 --> 12:00.152
As long as you grovel quickly,

12:00.280 --> 12:01.280
and have a good attitude,

12:01.719 --> 12:02.719
there's no argument.

12:03.839 --> 12:04.959
So wise.

12:10.639 --> 12:11.280
Thank you.

12:11.280 --> 12:12.280
You're welcome.

12:13.464 --> 12:15.040
I got offers from several architecture

12:15.040 --> 12:16.520
and design companies.

12:16.639 --> 12:17.639
I'm choosing.

12:17.839 --> 12:18.479
About him...

12:18.680 --> 12:20.639
He did projects
with the professor in school.

12:21.080 --> 12:22.359
He's at second master's year.

12:22.839 --> 12:24.320
I guess he'll go straight for a PhD.

12:24.879 --> 12:27.119
So, he's planning to stay
at the university to teach?

12:27.560 --> 12:28.599
You mean him?

12:31.639 --> 12:33.320
Isn't it annoying
to always be at school?

12:33.759 --> 12:35.479
Isn't he planning to try other jobs?

12:35.879 --> 12:37.560
He has a teacher named Bai Jiang.

12:39.200 --> 12:41.320
who hasn't got
a full professor qualification.

12:41.800 --> 12:42.240
However,

12:42.240 --> 12:43.680
he has been diligent all his life,

12:43.680 --> 12:45.160
and all the students really like him.

12:45.599 --> 12:46.201
I guess he

12:46.201 --> 12:48.119
is trying to take over Mr. Bai's baton.

12:48.680 --> 12:50.479
He wants to fight against the mundane.

12:52.119 --> 12:53.119
Then are you

12:53.119 --> 12:54.119
not worried?

12:54.320 --> 12:55.320
Worried about what?

12:55.680 --> 12:57.440
Those pretty female college students

12:57.440 --> 13:00.599
are eyeing your Professor Chen eagerly.

13:00.920 --> 13:02.759
I probably won't have to worry soon.

13:03.280 --> 13:04.560
He's going to propose soon?

13:04.560 --> 13:05.599
It should be soon, right?

13:06.200 --> 13:07.560
Congratulations in advance.

13:10.440 --> 13:12.920
The argument between you
and Zhu Yangqi isn't staged, is it?

13:14.839 --> 13:16.800
No wonder you look fearless.

13:16.800 --> 13:18.280
Are you in cahoots?

13:18.280 --> 13:19.320
And then,

13:19.320 --> 13:22.040
Chen Luzhou will come holding
a bouquet and a diamond ring,

13:22.200 --> 13:23.200
and propose to me.

13:23.280 --> 13:24.320
How is that possible?

13:24.320 --> 13:25.639
Who stages a fight?

13:25.639 --> 13:27.119
You still won't admit it?

13:27.280 --> 13:28.759
Your acting is terrible.

13:29.200 --> 13:30.200
I...

13:32.599 --> 13:33.680
Here it comes.

13:41.680 --> 13:42.680
For you.

13:43.440 --> 13:44.839
Yingying, don't be mad at me.

13:44.839 --> 13:45.920
It's all my fault anyway.

13:46.160 --> 13:47.520
Let's not argue anymore, okay?

13:47.719 --> 13:48.719
Stop it with this act.

13:50.639 --> 13:51.639
Let me take a call.

13:53.639 --> 13:54.639
Hello?

13:55.200 --> 13:56.239
I'm nearby.

13:56.879 --> 13:57.879
I'll be right over.

13:58.119 --> 13:59.280
There's an interview.

13:59.280 --> 14:00.639
The original host can't make it.

14:00.639 --> 14:01.639
I need to fill in.

14:01.639 --> 14:02.639
You guys dig in.

14:02.719 --> 14:03.839
I'll go with her.

14:06.680 --> 14:07.680
They just left?

14:10.040 --> 14:11.280
Anything you want to say?

14:12.239 --> 14:13.239
Say what?

14:13.839 --> 14:15.200
Why did you give me flowers?

14:17.879 --> 14:20.119
I saw Zhu Yangqi bought a bunch
for Cai Yingying.

14:20.119 --> 14:21.000
I'm afraid

14:21.000 --> 14:22.160
you'll be unhappy because

14:22.160 --> 14:23.160
she has and you don't.

14:23.800 --> 14:25.440
What does she have that I don't?

14:25.599 --> 14:26.281
Shy Boy Chen.

14:26.281 --> 14:28.040
You're so considerate and romantic.

14:29.839 --> 14:30.359
Why?

14:30.839 --> 14:32.560
You think I'm going to propose to you?

14:32.879 --> 14:33.879
Get lost.

14:37.320 --> 14:38.959
(June Styling Design)
Are you preparing to close down?

14:39.639 --> 14:41.440
We haven't received this news yet.

14:41.440 --> 14:42.240
Based on feedback,

14:42.240 --> 14:44.200
you refused to handle
the membership card refund.

14:44.359 --> 14:45.759
Is this true?

14:46.479 --> 14:47.520
I'm not sure either.

14:47.520 --> 14:48.160
This...

14:48.320 --> 14:49.320
You have to ask my boss.

14:49.479 --> 14:50.759
But your boss's phone is off?

14:50.759 --> 14:52.400
How do you explain this situation?

14:52.639 --> 14:53.080
I...

14:53.280 --> 14:54.280
What are you doing?

14:54.800 --> 14:55.479
What's this?

14:55.800 --> 14:56.560
Stop filming, okay?

14:56.560 --> 14:56.960
Stop.

14:56.960 --> 14:58.040
Don't fight.

14:58.639 --> 14:59.639
What are you doing?

15:05.320 --> 15:06.879
Don't take out anger on a girl.

15:07.879 --> 15:09.368
Brave enough to confront the police?

15:09.680 --> 15:10.719
You called the police?

15:11.520 --> 15:12.999
Your store has been reported by many.

15:12.999 --> 15:14.080
Many have complained.

15:14.959 --> 15:16.040
Business license.

15:16.160 --> 15:17.479
Take out your business license.

15:22.839 --> 15:24.200
I mentioned changing roles before.

15:24.520 --> 15:25.759
I don't disrespect your work,

15:26.320 --> 15:28.080
but I'm afraid of things like today.

15:31.680 --> 15:33.400
I know you're looking out for me.

15:33.719 --> 15:35.479
But I also want you to trust me.

15:35.479 --> 15:36.759
I'm an adult.

15:36.759 --> 15:38.400
I'm capable of taking care of myself.

15:40.160 --> 15:41.000
Promise me

15:41.000 --> 15:42.160
not be reckless.

15:43.879 --> 15:45.920
If you encounter
such unreasonable ones again.

15:46.239 --> 15:47.359
Don't confront them.

15:47.839 --> 15:48.879
Advancing through retreat.

15:48.879 --> 15:49.879
Safety first.

15:50.759 --> 15:52.119
Find a police officer.

15:54.359 --> 15:55.359
I promise you.

15:57.160 --> 15:57.720
One more thing

15:57.720 --> 15:58.800
you must promise me.

15:59.879 --> 16:00.879
What's it again?

16:01.599 --> 16:03.359
Get me off the blacklist, will you?

16:04.599 --> 16:05.639
Depends on your behavior.

16:05.639 --> 16:06.639
I'll think about it.

16:07.719 --> 16:08.119
Alright.

16:08.119 --> 16:09.119
Then think about it.

16:09.560 --> 16:10.639
I'll take you somewhere.

16:15.256 --> 16:18.869
♪We are not afraid of
the complicated world♪

16:19.224 --> 16:22.836
♪Only passionate love
like a ray of sunshine♪

16:23.320 --> 16:24.999
♪Can beat the night♪

16:24.999 --> 16:26.359
If you're still angry,

16:26.359 --> 16:27.639
hit them as if they were me.

16:29.464 --> 16:33.050
♪Let beautiful stories and wishes♪

16:33.432 --> 16:36.080
♪All blend into our season♪

16:36.080 --> 16:37.080
This.

16:37.080 --> 16:37.959
♪No matter how the future changes♪

16:37.959 --> 16:39.119
Why are you standing there?

16:39.119 --> 16:40.320
Why don't you help me?

16:40.320 --> 16:41.160
Hit together.

16:41.160 --> 16:42.200
Hit.

16:42.200 --> 16:42.759
Hit.

16:42.759 --> 16:43.759
Hit.

16:44.160 --> 16:45.160
This.

16:45.560 --> 16:46.280
Hit it.

16:46.280 --> 16:47.200
I did.

16:47.200 --> 16:48.200
This.

16:48.400 --> 16:49.400
This.

16:49.839 --> 16:50.839
Hit.

16:53.784 --> 16:58.291
♪All blend into our season♪

17:00.074 --> 17:01.221
(Reaching a Conclusion)

17:17.800 --> 17:19.080
(What I once feared the most)

17:19.480 --> 17:21.320
(were the words
"reaching a conclusion".)

17:22.800 --> 17:23.919
(Because there was a leader)

17:23.919 --> 17:25.679
(who didn't approve
my teaching philosophy)

17:27.119 --> 17:29.359
(and felt I wasn't suitable
for this education system)

17:29.639 --> 17:31.080
(and would be marginalized.)

17:31.839 --> 17:32.839
(Because of this,)

17:33.639 --> 17:35.119
(I considered early retirement.)

17:35.439 --> 17:36.520
(Until a few years ago,)

17:37.879 --> 17:39.839
(I took those children
to a competition.)

17:43.000 --> 17:44.000
Wait a moment.

17:44.839 --> 17:45.839
Mr. Bai.

17:46.639 --> 17:47.639
Come on.

17:47.839 --> 17:48.919
- Mr. Bai.
- Mr. Bai.

17:48.919 --> 17:49.920
- Mr. Bai.
- Mr. Bai.

17:49.920 --> 17:52.080
- Mr. Bai.
- Mr. Bai.

17:52.080 --> 17:52.840
- Mr. Bai.
- Mr. Bai.

17:52.840 --> 17:53.919
- Mr. Bai.
- Mr. Bai.

17:53.919 --> 17:54.520
- Mr. Bai.
- Mr. Bai.

17:54.520 --> 17:55.281
Hurry.

17:55.281 --> 17:56.399
Group photo together?

17:56.720 --> 17:57.720
For remembrance.

17:58.720 --> 17:59.720
What's the matter?

18:00.679 --> 18:02.280
What's so great about being the second?

18:02.639 --> 18:03.240
What's wrong?

18:03.240 --> 18:03.801
Yeah.

18:03.801 --> 18:04.839
We can't be high-profile?

18:04.960 --> 18:06.168
Discriminating against the second place?

18:07.080 --> 18:07.520
Come.

18:07.520 --> 18:08.359
Cheer up.

18:08.359 --> 18:08.760
Come.

18:09.159 --> 18:10.159
Three.

18:10.399 --> 18:11.399
Two.

18:11.599 --> 18:12.599
One.

18:13.839 --> 18:15.560
(Maybe for them, this matter)

18:15.560 --> 18:17.119
(doesn't hold much significance.)

18:19.399 --> 18:21.199
(But those kids made me feel that)

18:21.480 --> 18:23.359
(even when they reach fifty,)

18:24.720 --> 18:26.000
(they still wouldn't care)

18:26.199 --> 18:27.960
(whether others make a final judgment.)

18:30.080 --> 18:31.199
(After the competition,)

18:32.040 --> 18:34.240
(one of the students sent me an email.)

18:35.679 --> 18:36.800
(He's very outstanding.)

18:37.919 --> 18:39.679
(Whenever mentioning him,)

18:40.199 --> 18:41.760
(I always proudly say)

18:42.359 --> 18:43.599
(that I'm his teacher.)

18:46.960 --> 18:47.640
(In the email,)

18:47.640 --> 18:49.159
(he also said something to me.)

18:50.520 --> 18:51.760
(I still remember to this day.)

18:53.560 --> 18:54.879
(He said, "Mr. Bai.")

18:55.760 --> 18:56.600
("From any angle,")

18:56.600 --> 18:57.839
("you shine")

18:58.320 --> 18:59.599
("with handsomeness.")

19:02.839 --> 19:04.159
(I'm gratified.)

19:05.839 --> 19:07.480
(After all, it's been over fifty years,)

19:07.480 --> 19:08.879
(and nobody said I'm handsome.)

19:09.720 --> 19:10.080
(Okay.)

19:10.639 --> 19:11.639
(Then)

19:12.480 --> 19:13.240
(the conclusion)

19:13.439 --> 19:14.439
(is reached.)

19:33.599 --> 19:34.800
Tissues are provided.

19:37.040 --> 19:38.040
Thanks.

19:42.000 --> 19:43.000
Thank you.

20:08.320 --> 20:09.320
Buy a drink?

20:11.639 --> 20:12.080
Boss.

20:12.080 --> 20:13.080
What would you like?

20:13.560 --> 20:14.760
Two bottles of soda water.

20:14.760 --> 20:15.240
Okay.

20:15.520 --> 20:16.081
Thank you.

20:16.081 --> 20:18.119
I got fifty points higher
than my third mock exam.

20:18.119 --> 20:19.280
Enough for Huaguang.

20:20.240 --> 20:21.919
I still don't know what major to choose.

20:22.040 --> 20:23.199
My dad said medicine.

20:23.199 --> 20:24.599
My mom wants me to study new media.

20:24.800 --> 20:26.280
I think new media is pretty good.

20:26.520 --> 20:27.520
Don't like it.

20:27.720 --> 20:28.720
What about you?

20:29.320 --> 20:30.320
Me?

20:30.520 --> 20:31.599
I'm planning to do acting.

20:33.199 --> 20:34.199
Not bad.

20:34.520 --> 20:36.000
Time flies so fast.

20:36.560 --> 20:38.720
So many stores here are gone already.

20:39.040 --> 20:40.800
The buildings will be torn down soon.

20:40.800 --> 20:41.800
Want to go and see?

20:45.320 --> 20:46.320
Let's go.

20:53.199 --> 20:54.800
Is the door not closed properly?

20:55.720 --> 20:56.720
I'll go check.

21:14.399 --> 21:15.200
Come in, please.

21:15.200 --> 21:16.240
Welcome.

21:16.240 --> 21:16.920
Please.

21:16.920 --> 21:18.320
What's going on?

21:36.480 --> 21:37.480
Are you not coming over?

21:37.720 --> 21:38.720
Go.

21:42.000 --> 21:43.000
Hurry up.

21:45.919 --> 21:46.919
Come closer.

21:48.199 --> 21:49.199
You...

21:51.960 --> 21:52.520
A bit hot.

21:52.679 --> 21:53.720
The air conditioner is on.

21:53.919 --> 21:54.919
Really?

21:55.159 --> 21:56.560
Are you nervous?

21:58.839 --> 22:00.080
My heart rate is almost at 180.

22:00.199 --> 22:02.399
Should I call 120 for you just in case?

22:06.760 --> 22:08.000
He blushed.

22:10.199 --> 22:11.240
We have to take photos.

22:12.040 --> 22:13.159
Do you want to tidy up?

22:13.520 --> 22:14.919
Do I not look good now?

22:15.439 --> 22:16.439
You look good.

22:17.439 --> 22:18.679
I have a filter for you.

22:19.040 --> 22:20.119
At any time, in my eyes,

22:20.119 --> 22:21.240
you're incredibly beautiful.

22:22.320 --> 22:23.321
So cheesy.

22:23.321 --> 22:24.359
It's so hot.

22:24.359 --> 22:25.560
Yes, very hot.

22:25.560 --> 22:26.879
Then why don't you kneel down?

22:30.399 --> 22:31.399
Give me your phone.

22:33.560 --> 22:34.560
What for?

22:35.560 --> 22:36.560
Bro.

22:41.960 --> 22:42.960
What for?

22:54.744 --> 22:57.476
♪In the darkness,
you are like fireworks♪

22:57.720 --> 23:00.728
♪Unattainable♪

23:00.866 --> 23:03.000
♪How much time is needed♪

23:03.359 --> 23:04.359
How come you...

23:04.439 --> 23:05.839
Why did you put it here?

23:06.320 --> 23:08.000
You don't play by the rules.

23:08.399 --> 23:09.599
I have to be cautious.

23:10.320 --> 23:11.480
Wasn't this a New Year gift

23:11.480 --> 23:13.800
for Zhi four years ago?

23:14.720 --> 23:15.481
I got it.

23:15.481 --> 23:17.040
Impressive, Lucy.

23:17.359 --> 23:19.879
He's worried Zhi might suddenly
propose to him.

23:19.879 --> 23:21.199
Adapt by staying unchanged.

23:21.399 --> 23:23.119
He prepared this ring early on.

23:24.110 --> 23:25.784
♪Don't be afraid,
what you've experienced♪

23:25.784 --> 23:28.596
♪Remains in the heart♪

23:28.760 --> 23:32.532
♪You'll realize
your long-desired dreams♪

23:32.696 --> 23:35.800
♪Open your arms to embrace the breeze♪

23:35.800 --> 23:37.280
Chen Luzhou.

23:38.520 --> 23:39.520
Zhi,

23:41.399 --> 23:42.399
marry me.

23:44.240 --> 23:44.760
What?

23:45.119 --> 23:46.080
What? I can't hear.

23:46.080 --> 23:47.001
Did you hear it?

23:47.001 --> 23:48.119
I can't hear.

23:48.119 --> 23:49.119
Louder.

23:50.520 --> 23:51.520
Xu Zhi,

23:52.119 --> 23:53.119
will you marry me?

23:53.119 --> 23:55.296
♪Don't give it an answer♪

23:56.052 --> 23:58.328
♪I'm the same♪

23:58.879 --> 24:00.320
Yes, Shy Boy Chen.

24:02.800 --> 24:04.320
Oh my, I can't take it.

24:13.528 --> 24:16.410
♪Peel away the soft shell♪

24:16.410 --> 24:19.554
♪I want to understand your fragility♪

24:19.554 --> 24:20.199
♪The sky will have the morning sun♪

24:20.199 --> 24:21.439
The puppy is wagging its tail.

24:22.360 --> 24:24.359
♪And you always have me♪

24:24.359 --> 24:26.359
Because the puppy is wagging its tail.

24:26.936 --> 24:28.760
♪Don't be afraid,
what you've experienced♪

24:28.760 --> 24:31.238
♪Remains in the heart♪

24:31.736 --> 24:35.499
♪You'll realize
your long-desired dreams♪

24:35.608 --> 24:39.194
♪Open your arms to embrace the breeze♪

24:39.919 --> 24:42.000
Congratulations!

24:43.032 --> 24:44.472
♪Look, this city♪

24:44.472 --> 24:46.935
♪It keeps raining♪

24:47.448 --> 24:49.342
♪Ticking and tattling♪

24:49.342 --> 24:51.416
♪Who is worried♪

24:51.672 --> 24:53.280
♪I believe
you can't find a reason either♪

24:53.280 --> 24:54.599
Come, shall we take a photo?

24:54.599 --> 24:55.599
Come, come on.

24:55.599 --> 24:56.599
Take a photo.

24:56.919 --> 24:57.919
Kid, squat down.

24:58.000 --> 24:59.000
Yes.

25:00.960 --> 25:01.679
Stand tight.

25:01.679 --> 25:02.199
Come.

25:02.480 --> 25:04.119
- Okay, delay timer.
- Hurry.

25:04.639 --> 25:05.399
Chen Luzhou,

25:05.399 --> 25:06.399
turn around and look.

25:10.104 --> 25:13.289
♪Yet we are still♪

25:14.136 --> 25:16.144
♪For ages♪

25:17.080 --> 25:18.199
Kids can't watch.

25:18.199 --> 25:19.160
I'm not the kid.

25:19.160 --> 25:20.320
I'm almost going to college.

25:20.679 --> 25:21.679
Hurry.

25:21.879 --> 25:22.960
Still taking photos?

25:23.119 --> 25:23.839
Continuous shoot.

25:23.839 --> 25:24.520
Never mind.

25:24.520 --> 25:25.241
Hurry, Cherry.

25:25.241 --> 25:26.960
- One, two, three.
- One, two, three.

25:27.240 --> 25:29.040
Cherry.

25:30.104 --> 25:31.800
♪Don't be afraid,
what you've experienced♪

25:31.800 --> 25:34.213
♪Remains in the heart♪

25:34.680 --> 25:38.337
♪You'll realize
your long-desired dreams♪

25:38.584 --> 25:42.202
♪Open your arms to embrace the breeze♪

25:42.296 --> 25:44.952
♪Together with you♪

25:47.512 --> 25:50.064
♪In the midsummer♪

25:50.424 --> 25:54.152
♪The sequel of the story
has never stopped♪

25:54.392 --> 25:58.040
♪I'll still be by your side♪

25:58.040 --> 26:01.282
♪Through all seasons♪

26:02.104 --> 26:05.235
♪Shall we go to the future♪

26:09.040 --> 26:10.399
Why suddenly bring me here?

26:16.119 --> 26:17.119
There's a surprise.

26:19.608 --> 26:21.292
Haven't come
in the evening in a long time.

26:37.919 --> 26:39.879
Didn't you want one with a parking lot?

26:48.119 --> 26:50.439
The day Yingying and Zhu Yangqi fought,

26:50.639 --> 26:51.639
I thought you were

26:52.040 --> 26:53.040
going to propose.

26:54.040 --> 26:55.480
But it was a misunderstanding.

26:57.000 --> 26:58.320
Ms. Wei told me

26:59.119 --> 27:01.040
the man should propose.

27:01.280 --> 27:02.399
But I don't think so.

27:02.839 --> 27:03.839
I don't think

27:04.879 --> 27:06.879
it's that important
who takes the initiative.

27:07.599 --> 27:08.599
Right?

27:09.480 --> 27:10.679
So, you originally planned

27:11.119 --> 27:12.280
to propose to me first.

27:13.359 --> 27:14.359
I think

27:14.639 --> 27:16.159
if you can't do it,

27:16.159 --> 27:17.159
then I'll do it.

27:17.280 --> 27:18.720
But I was still one step behind you.

27:26.960 --> 27:27.960
That's impressive.

27:30.439 --> 27:31.439
Well...

27:32.439 --> 27:33.800
The house is already prepared.

27:34.399 --> 27:35.839
Can you marry me now,

27:36.000 --> 27:37.000
Shy Boy Chen?

27:39.159 --> 27:41.080
It seems being the man behind Zhi

27:41.080 --> 27:42.081
is quite happy, right?

27:42.081 --> 27:43.280
Of course.

27:45.599 --> 27:46.599
Okay.

27:57.439 --> 27:58.560
What should I do, Xu Zhi?

27:59.639 --> 28:01.040
We've dated nearly five years.

28:02.280 --> 28:03.320
I still love you a lot.

28:08.159 --> 28:09.679
We've been together for so long.

28:10.760 --> 28:13.159
If I had bought a potential stock
and held it long-term,

28:13.439 --> 28:15.040
I would be a rich woman by now.

28:16.879 --> 28:18.480
Sometimes you talk bad.

28:18.800 --> 28:20.040
Do you still like me like this?

28:20.199 --> 28:21.199
I don't like it.

28:21.919 --> 28:23.119
I don't like it at all.

28:26.560 --> 28:27.560
I like it.

28:30.679 --> 28:31.679
Do you know?

28:32.199 --> 28:34.000
I've been having a feeling recently.

28:34.879 --> 28:35.879
What kind of feeling?

28:36.199 --> 28:37.359
The feeling

28:37.359 --> 28:38.359
of being very fortunate.

28:38.919 --> 28:40.639
And feeling a bit fearful
at the same time.

28:42.000 --> 28:43.520
Grateful to have you by my side,

28:45.119 --> 28:47.320
and afraid of how life would be
if we hadn't met.

28:50.919 --> 28:51.520
Forget it.

28:51.879 --> 28:52.919
Let's not overthink it.

28:53.560 --> 28:54.800
I've already figured it out.

28:55.359 --> 28:56.399
Life, you know,

28:56.399 --> 28:57.560
has its bright moments

28:57.800 --> 28:58.960
and its dark moments as well.

28:59.359 --> 29:01.399
During the bright times,
we boldly move forward.

29:01.839 --> 29:02.960
And during the dark times,

29:03.320 --> 29:05.199
we just hold onto
each other's hands tightly.

29:13.304 --> 29:16.624
♪On a midsummer night♪

29:17.088 --> 29:22.040
♪The drowsy streetlights
softly start to mend♪

29:22.040 --> 29:23.040
I love you.

29:23.560 --> 29:24.560
Shy Boy Chen.

29:26.800 --> 29:27.800
I love you too.

29:28.599 --> 29:29.599
Xu Zhi.

29:33.560 --> 29:35.908
♪On the mountaintop
where the shooting stars pass♪

29:36.152 --> 29:38.289
♪The silhouette is frozen in eternity♪

29:38.872 --> 29:41.304
♪Fireworks, cicadas chirping,
heartbeat breathing♪

29:41.304 --> 29:43.830
♪The whole world pauses♪

29:44.568 --> 29:47.495
♪Messages connecting the universe♪

29:49.208 --> 29:51.391
♪Billions of shooting stars♪

29:51.608 --> 29:54.416
♪Following the path of the galaxy♪

29:54.416 --> 29:56.522
♪Falling into your eyes♪

29:59.544 --> 30:01.615
♪Billions of raindrops♪

30:02.104 --> 30:04.632
♪Like the universe's response♪

30:04.632 --> 30:06.873
♪Landing in my heart's depth♪

30:17.496 --> 30:21.141
♪We met across billions of light-years♪

30:28.159 --> 30:29.600
(Zhi)

30:35.520 --> 30:36.040
Hello?

30:36.320 --> 30:36.839
What's up?

30:37.280 --> 30:38.280
Cooking.

30:39.040 --> 30:40.040
When will you be back?

30:40.800 --> 30:42.080
Working overtime tonight.

30:42.080 --> 30:43.199
I won't be back for dinner.

30:43.839 --> 30:46.760
But I promise I'll see you off
at the airport tomorrow.

30:47.639 --> 30:49.040
Don't be mad at me, okay?

30:50.240 --> 30:51.240
I'm used to it.

30:51.760 --> 30:52.800
Holding hands in the dark.

30:52.800 --> 30:54.199
Walk forward when it's bright.

30:54.679 --> 30:55.839
Shy Boy Chen.

30:56.199 --> 30:57.359
You sound jealous.

30:57.480 --> 30:58.639
Come back early.

30:59.520 --> 31:00.520
I made supper.

31:01.199 --> 31:02.199
Bye.

31:19.720 --> 31:20.720
Hello?

31:21.080 --> 31:21.720
Are we still on?

31:22.080 --> 31:23.080
Chen Luzhou.

31:23.240 --> 31:24.199
Treat me like a person.

31:24.199 --> 31:24.920
Alright.

31:24.920 --> 31:26.159
Zhi isn't home for dinner.

31:26.159 --> 31:27.560
That's when you think of me.

31:27.560 --> 31:28.560
Stop nagging.

31:29.199 --> 31:30.199
As usual.

31:30.960 --> 31:31.599
Hurry up.

31:31.599 --> 31:32.599
I'm already here.

31:32.720 --> 31:33.720
Okay.

31:45.919 --> 31:46.919
I'm wondering.

31:47.199 --> 31:49.399
Other newly engaged couples

31:49.960 --> 31:51.359
are clingy.

31:52.320 --> 31:53.879
Zhi is so aloof.

31:54.040 --> 31:55.919
Knowing you're going
to Ruicheng for exchange,

31:56.119 --> 31:58.119
she can't wait to get rid of you.

31:58.359 --> 31:59.359
Those who don't know

31:59.839 --> 32:01.760
may think she couldn't wait
to separate from you.

32:01.919 --> 32:03.159
That's enough.

32:08.536 --> 32:09.680
You're going to Ruicheng.

32:09.680 --> 32:11.159
Then what about your fifth anniversary?

32:11.159 --> 32:12.159
Isn't it coming soon?

32:15.399 --> 32:16.399
Zhi

32:16.919 --> 32:18.639
didn't say she'd celebrate early

32:19.119 --> 32:20.119
or

32:20.240 --> 32:21.480
make it up to you later?

32:30.960 --> 32:32.199
Chen Luzhou.

32:32.839 --> 32:34.439
It's been five whole years.

32:34.720 --> 32:36.359
I finally made it through

32:36.639 --> 32:38.839
your passionate relationship
with Xu Zhi.

32:39.240 --> 32:39.879
Drinking or not?

32:39.879 --> 32:40.879
If not, I'm leaving.

32:43.199 --> 32:44.199
Luzhou.

32:45.919 --> 32:47.240
As long as you say that your

32:47.760 --> 32:49.439
passionate relationship with Xu Zhi

32:49.439 --> 32:50.560
is over,

32:50.560 --> 32:52.639
then I'll transfer you
a thousand bucks right now.

32:56.199 --> 32:57.960
Brotherhood is greater than anything.

32:58.520 --> 32:59.839
What's a girl worth anyway?

33:00.159 --> 33:01.320
I'm here for you until dawn.

33:01.320 --> 33:02.320
No need.

33:02.720 --> 33:03.760
What's brotherhood worth?

33:04.800 --> 33:06.280
My girl will introduce new friends.

33:10.800 --> 33:11.800
Okay.

33:27.560 --> 33:28.560
I'm off to the airport.

33:29.520 --> 33:31.000
Okay, then I'll see you off.

33:42.599 --> 33:44.960
Have you gotten
a bit tired of me lately?

33:45.599 --> 33:46.800
Don't overthink it.

33:47.679 --> 33:48.679
Xu Zhi.

33:49.080 --> 33:50.240
I know you don't love me.

33:52.000 --> 33:52.400
Are you

33:52.400 --> 33:54.320
going to say this to me
until I'm a hundred?

33:55.000 --> 33:56.439
If you don't love me, just say it.

33:56.720 --> 33:57.879
I can give up sooner.

34:01.359 --> 34:02.960
After you get there, eat well

34:02.960 --> 34:03.960
and study well.

34:04.159 --> 34:05.240
Honor the homeland.

34:05.359 --> 34:06.359
After you come back,

34:06.480 --> 34:07.720
I'll cook a big meal

34:07.720 --> 34:08.720
to reward you.

34:09.719 --> 34:10.719
Your husband won't mind

34:10.840 --> 34:12.040
if I come by, right?

34:15.400 --> 34:16.719
Just don't tell him.

34:19.599 --> 34:20.119
It's okay.

34:20.119 --> 34:21.119
You go ahead.

34:21.239 --> 34:22.400
I can go by myself.

34:22.840 --> 34:23.840
Sorry.

34:24.080 --> 34:25.440
